      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "bashir",
      "text": "The Titan Tower. It climbs past the clouds, and the clouds are made of lightning."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "bashir",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "camera",
      "x": 12.5,
      "y": -2,
      "viewHeight": 8,
      "duration": 2.5
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "king",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "king",
      "text": "So the mason's apprentice reaches the top of the world."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "king",
      "text": "Do you know what your master was, Arslan? He was mine. My engineer. He laid the first stones of this tower."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "king",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "camera",
      "x": 6,
      "y": -1.8,
      "viewHeight": 9,
      "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "hero",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "You lie."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "hero",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "king",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "king",
      "text": "When the star fell, it was Idris who beat it into a crown for me. And when he saw what it made of me, it was Idris who broke it."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "king",
      "text": "He scattered the shards among the kings of the earth. He thought no single king could hold them all."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "king",
      "text": "He was right. So I ruled through all of them."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "king",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "king",
      "pose": "point"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "king",
      "text": "And when I found the old thief at last, I sent my Hand. Tell him, Hand. Tell him how Idris died."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "king",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "camera",
      "x": 13.5,
      "y": -2,
      "viewHeight": 7,
      "duration": 1.2
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "ironhand",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "ironhand",
      "text": "Sethmose told you he begged. He did not."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "ironhand",
      "text": "He looked up at me and said, every wall has a flaw. Then he closed his eyes."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "ironhand",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "wait",
      "duration": 1
    },
    {
      "type": "camera",
      "x": 3,
      "y": -1.6,
      "viewHeight": 7,
      "duration": 1.5
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "hero",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "Every wall has a flaw. He was not saying farewell. He was telling me where to look."
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "You wear the last shard, King. The heart of the star. Every piece I carry pulls toward it. That is your flaw."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "hero",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "camera",
      "x": 11,
      "y": -2,
      "viewHeight": 8,
      "duration": 1.2
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "king",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "king",
      "text": "Then come and take it. This tower has never fallen, and neither have I."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "king",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "parallel",
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "pose",
          "actor": "king",
          "pose": "walk",
          "facing": 1
        },
        {
          "type": "pose",
          "actor": "ironhand",
          "pose": "walk",
          "facing": 1
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "parallel",
      "steps": [
        {
          "type": "move",
          "actor": "king",
          "x": 19,
          "duration": 2
        },
        {
          "type": "move",
          "actor": "ironhand",
          "x": 20,
          "duration": 1.8
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "remove",
      "actor": "king"
    },
    {
      "type": "remove",
      "actor": "ironhand"
    },
    {
      "type": "camera",
      "x": -1,
      "y": -1.6,
      "viewHeight": 7,
      "duration": 2
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "liwei",
      "pose": "point"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "liwei",
      "text": "The tower stands on floating stones, chained together at the base. Cut the chains, and it has nothing left to stand on."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "liwei",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "roxana",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "roxana",
      "text": "Star-iron chains. My fire will have to burn hotter than it ever has. It will."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "roxana",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "titus",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "titus",
      "text": "I carried a ram up the Colosseum steps. I will carry one into the sky if I must."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "titus",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "bashir",
      "pose": "talk"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "bashir",
      "text": "And remember, General. Idris built this tower. Every mason leaves one stone loose."
    },
    {
      "type": "pose",
      "actor": "bashir",
      "pose": "stand"
    },
    {
      "type": "say",
      "speaker": "hero",
      "text": "For Master Idris. For Garin. For every kingdom that wore his chains. Bring down the Titan Tower."
    },
